===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|σπέρμα||sperm|tr=sperma|lang=grc}} + {{term|ζῷον||living thing|tr=zōon|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˌspɜːmətə(ʊ)ˈzəʊɒn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|spermatozoa}}

# {{context|cytology|lang=en}} The reproductive cell or [[gamete]] of the male, carried in [[semen]], that fertilizes the [[ovum]] to produce the [[zygote]].

====Synonyms====
